!package.json
# The root `prepare` derives TELO_SURFACE_VERSION from the changesets `fixed`
# group and the pending changesets; it reads every member of that group,
# language-server and cel included, and writes the engine's identity into it.
# A line member the CLI does not otherwise need is still read here, so leaving
# one out fails the image build rather than merely shipping less.
!.changeset
!packages/language-server
!cel/nodejs
# The SDK's message core; its `prepare` generates its module from the CLDR data.
!message-format/nodejs
!message-format/cldr
!packages/editor-protocol
!pnpm-*
!tsconfig.base.json

